{"id":"7776a98a623ada8d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-boolean-circuit.md","title":"df-boolean-circuit (Boolean Circuit)","display":"df-boolean-circuit (Boolean Circuit)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":[],"display":"df-boolean-circuit (Boolean Circuit)","label":"28-df-boolean-circuit","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-boolean-circuit","Boolean Circuit"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and 6.25","source_printed_pages":"107–108,118","source_pdf_pages":"133–134,144","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-circuit (Boolean Circuit)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-boolean-circuit"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-boolean-circuit</span><span>Boolean Circuit</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and 6.25"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108,118"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"133–134,144"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=[N]=\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\">\\(V=[N]=\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\ge n\">\\(N\\ge n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\ge1\">\\(N\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>电路候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\">\\(C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\imath=(i_1,\\ldots,i_n)\">\\(\\vec\\imath=(i_1,\\ldots,i_n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec o=(o_1,\\ldots,o_m)\">\\(\\vec o=(o_1,\\ldots,o_m)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_n=\\{\\mathsf{in}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{in}_n,0,1,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{not}\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_n=\\{\\mathsf{in}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{in}_n,0,1,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{not}\\}\\)</span>，不同标签互异。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式构造一般无界扇入电路、求值、族以及有界扇入子类；空乘积取一。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>。相邻字串表示连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 表示按下标递增连接，空连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>，字串坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 起。编码式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=|V|\">\\(N=|V|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tag}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{tag}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{adjword}\">\\(\\operatorname{adjword}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\;&amp;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(N\\ge n\\land V=[N]),\\ E\\subseteq V^2,\\ \\vec\\imath\\in V^n,\\ \\vec o\\in V^m,\\ \\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_n,\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\lambda:V\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(u,v)\\in E\\ \\lambda(u)&lt;\\lambda(v),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall j,k\\in[n]\\ (j\\ne k\\Rightarrow i_j\\ne i_k),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall v\\in V\\ (\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j\\leftrightarrow v=i_j),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{\\mathsf{in}_j:j\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{0,1\\}\\Rightarrow\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}=\\varnothing],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not}\\Rightarrow|\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}|=1]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\;&amp;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(N\\ge n\\land V=[N]),\\ E\\subseteq V^2,\\ \\vec\\imath\\in V^n,\\ \\vec o\\in V^m,\\ \\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_n,\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\lambda:V\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(u,v)\\in E\\ \\lambda(u)&lt;\\lambda(v),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall j,k\\in[n]\\ (j\\ne k\\Rightarrow i_j\\ne i_k),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall v\\in V\\ (\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j\\leftrightarrow v=i_j),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{\\mathsf{in}_j:j\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{0,1\\}\\Rightarrow\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}=\\varnothing],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not}\\Rightarrow|\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}|=1]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or}\\}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|\\le2].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or}\\}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|\\le2].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nx_j&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\\nb&amp;\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not},\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{and},\\\\\n1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{or}.\n\\end{cases}\\qquad(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nx_j&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\\nb&amp;\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not},\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{and},\\\\\n1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))&amp;\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{or}.\n\\end{cases}\\qquad(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_m)\\rangle,\\qquad \\prod\\varnothing\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_m)\\rangle,\\qquad \\prod\\varnothing\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\coloneqq\\{(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\forall n\\ C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\coloneqq\\{(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\forall n\\ C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tag}_n(0)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(1)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{and})\\coloneqq2,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{or})\\coloneqq3,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{not})\\coloneqq4,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{in}_j)\\coloneqq j+4\\quad(j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tag}_n(0)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(1)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{and})\\coloneqq2,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{or})\\coloneqq3,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{not})\\coloneqq4,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{in}_j)\\coloneqq j+4\\quad(j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{adjword}(C)\\in\\Sigma^{N^2},\\qquad\\operatorname{adjword}(C)_{(u-1)N+v}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[(u,v)\\in E]\\quad(u,v\\in[N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{adjword}(C)\\in\\Sigma^{N^2},\\qquad\\operatorname{adjword}(C)_{(u-1)N+v}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[(u,v)\\in E]\\quad(u,v\\in[N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^{n}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(i_j)\\right)\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^{m}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(o_j)\\right)\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^{N}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\tau(v)))\\right)\\operatorname{adjword}(C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^{n}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(i_j)\\right)\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^{m}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(o_j)\\right)\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^{N}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\tau(v)))\\right)\\operatorname{adjword}(C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有限无环图上的拓扑递归保证求值存在且唯一。书中基本模型的 AND/OR 扇入为二；本节点将一般模型扩展到无界扇入，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BF}\">\\(\\operatorname{BF}\\)</span> 显式选出有界模型，以同时支持 NC 与 AC。常量门和零输入长度补足边界情形。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definitions 6.1–6.2 and 6.25，印刷页 107–108,118；PDF 页 133–134,144。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次内容补全：电路类中的顶点数由存在量词绑定，不再暗依赖 Hypothesis 中某个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。编码保留实例原有编号，不要求重新拓扑排序；整数前缀码和由头部确定的表长使各字段可唯一解析。编号与标签字段可用对数工作空间逐位读取；电路合法性（包括无环性）可在编码长度的多项式时间内判定。矩阵表示与原编号邻接表的长度彼此多项式有界，门模型及 size、depth 的计量未变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"V=[N]=\\{1,\\ldots,N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N\\ge n","display":false},{"tex":"N\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\imath=(i_1,\\ldots,i_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec o=(o_1,\\ldots,o_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_n=\\{\\mathsf{in}_1,\\ldots,\\mathsf{in}_n,0,1,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{not}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}","display":false},{"tex":"N=|V|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tag}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{adjword}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau):\\;&\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(N\\ge n\\land V=[N]),\\ E\\subseteq V^2,\\ \\vec\\imath\\in V^n,\\ \\vec o\\in V^m,\\ \\tau:V\\to\\Gamma_n,\\\\\n&\\exists\\lambda:V\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(u,v)\\in E\\ \\lambda(u)<\\lambda(v),\\\\\n&\\forall j,k\\in[n]\\ (j\\ne k\\Rightarrow i_j\\ne i_k),\\\\\n&\\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall v\\in V\\ (\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j\\leftrightarrow v=i_j),\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{\\mathsf{in}_j:j\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{0,1\\}\\Rightarrow\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}=\\varnothing],\\\\\n&\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not}\\Rightarrow|\\{u\\in V:(u,v)\\in E\\}|=1]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\forall v\\in V\\ [\\tau(v)\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or}\\}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|\\le2].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nx_j&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{in}_j,\\\\\nb&\\tau(v)=b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{not},\\ \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\{u\\},\\\\\n\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u)&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{and},\\\\\n1-\\prod_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}(1-\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(u))&\\tau(v)=\\mathsf{or}.\n\\end{cases}\\qquad(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m},\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{C,x}(o_m)\\rangle,\\qquad \\prod\\varnothing\\coloneqq1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\coloneqq\\{(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\forall n\\ C_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tag}_n(0)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(1)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{and})\\coloneqq2,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{or})\\coloneqq3,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{not})\\coloneqq4,\\quad\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\mathsf{in}_j)\\coloneqq j+4\\quad(j\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{adjword}(C)\\in\\Sigma^{N^2},\\qquad\\operatorname{adjword}(C)_{(u-1)N+v}\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[(u,v)\\in E]\\quad(u,v\\in[N]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\coloneqq{}&\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(m)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(N)\\\\\n&\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^{n}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(i_j)\\right)\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^{m}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(o_j)\\right)\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^{N}\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm C}(\\operatorname{tag}_n(\\tau(v)))\\right)\\operatorname{adjword}(C).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BF}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false}],"bytes":5085,"backlinks":[{"id":"51d96e53efebc2d6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0761cc6d55d40d5e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}$ (布尔电路, see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]])"},{"id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"157aaa9ee5788515","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。$\\operatorname{desc}$ 为下式给出的编码限制。配对串采用 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]] 的 $\\langle u,v\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v)$。"},{"id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{BF}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；非输入门数 $\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。"},{"id":"a11f0e3e49cef083","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。"},{"id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"154f028fc8ad4b75","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}$ 为其既有门标签；$\\mathsf M$ 是互异新增标签。$\\operatorname{depth}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-depth]]。"},{"id":"73478f2dc71b6e9e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；输入和常量标签沿用该定义。"},{"id":"4c85902878b27217","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。"},{"id":"348985e8f6